<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The DQ Sundae — Simple and Reliable</h2>
  <p>The Hot Fudge Sundae is the most straightforward treat on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>: warm fudge over cold soft serve. The temperature contrast between the warm sauce and cold cream is the entire appeal. It is 300 calories, $3.79, and delivers exactly what it promises every time. No Blizzard complexity, no parfait layering — just a clean, classic sundae.</p>
  <h2>The $7 Meal Deal Sundae Connection</h2>
  <p>The Hot Fudge Sundae (Small) is one of the dessert choices included in the <a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal</a>. The deal includes a cheeseburger or 3-piece chicken strips, Regular Fries, a Soft Drink, and a Small Sundae — all for $7.00. If you are ordering the $7 Meal Deal and want a dessert, the Hot Fudge Sundae is the most popular choice.</p>
  <h2>Sundae Flavor Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Sundae Flavor</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Hot Fudge</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>300</td><td>Warm chocolate, most popular</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Strawberry</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>280</td><td>Fruity, slightly lighter calorie</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Caramel</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.79</td><td>310</td><td>Sweet, rich caramel</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
