    <h2>Hot Fudge Sundae vs. Peanut Buster Parfait</h2>
    <p>Both use DQ soft serve and hot fudge sauce. The <a href="/items/peanut-buster-parfait">Peanut Buster Parfait</a> ($4.99, 710 cal) adds layers of salted peanuts and significantly more fudge in a tall parfait cup. The Hot Fudge Sundae is simpler — fudge on soft serve, nothing else. Choose the Parfait for a true indulgence. Choose the Sundae when you want a quick, light, reliable dessert.</p>
